::  name       blaze store dir count
::  shape      dirs - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a Store holds exactly three directory handles (root - blaze -
::  blobs)
::  example    3
::  readers    Blaze - Glow Tend - Sur museum - Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e206-blaze-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e206 - Blaze M4 -- fourth Blaze structure pedestal in src/shape/.
::  Names Store's directory count from blaze/src/store.rye: the repository
::  root, the .blaze/ tree, and .blaze/blobs/. Pedestal only; Rye still
::  owns open - put - get and the sha3 blob names.
+$  blaze-store-dir-count-shape
  $:  dirs=@u32
  ==
